            "uuid": "RationaleClaim_NonSafety_ExteriorLightingDesign_IndicatorResponseTime_@410ea69d",
            "description": [
                "EL-RSP-1 on ExteriorLightingDesign is implied by the budget EL-RSP-1.1 to 1.4 along the signal path:",
                "",
                "- input to rear lamp: 50 (1.1) + 60 (1.2) + 65 (1.4) = 175 ms \u2264 200 ms, input to front lamp 50 + 60 + 20 (1.3) = 130 ms;",
                "- front and rear lamps are driven by the same TurnLightControl transmission, so only the lamp paths differ: rear later by at most 65 \u2212 10 = 55 ms, front later by at most 20 \u2212 10 = 10 ms, both \u2264 80 ms.",
                "",
                "LightingIndication is not part of EL-RSP-1, which is about the lamps.",
                "",
                "```mermaid",
                "flowchart LR",
                "  s[\"1.1 SCCM<br/>\u2264 50 ms\"] --> c[\"1.2 BCM<br/>\u2264 60 ms\"]",
                "  c --> f[\"1.3 FLCM<br/>10\u201320 ms\"]",
                "  c --> r[\"1.4 RearLight<br/>10\u201365 ms\"]",
                "```",
                "",
                "Worst cases and margins are derived in EL_Indicator_Response_Time_Analysis.md."
            ],
            "name": "RationaleClaim_NonSafety_ExteriorLightingDesign_IndicatorResponseTime",
